# DevOps / deploy

- Production is a Docker Compose stack on the VM. A push to `main` runs `.github/workflows/deploy.yml` (fresh VM / full rebuild: `scripts/remote-deploy.py`)—see `docs/DEPLOYMENT.md`.
- Do not push to `main` unless that change should deploy. The workflow never writes `/opt/cullinos/.env`.
- Always include rollback notes (`docs/BACKUP_ROLLBACK.md`) in deploy-related changes.
- Never weaken `security.yml` checks without an explicit human decision recorded in the PR.
